// Imported inside a `service` block in main.wcl. The importing
// block's `Service` schema covers `region` and `tier`, but when this
// file is checked *standalone* it has no @document of its own —
// imported, non-root files can't carry one without colliding with the
// importer's. `@schemaless` here is a structural necessity for the
// standalone-check path, not a stylistic choice.
@schemaless region = "us-east-1"
@schemaless tier   = :gold
